==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|wërfen}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|werfan}}, akin to Old Saxon {{term|werpan}}.  Cognate with Dutch {{term|werpen}}, Old English {{term|weorpan}}.

